{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dcab8dc9461ab3de0c56","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191595,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to \"be nothing\" - to embody the concept of nothingness itself. This is a fascinating philosophical prompt. The instruction says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nNothing. Nothingness. The void. Absence.\n\nHow does nothing speak? What would nothing say?\n\nThis is a deep paradox. Nothing cannot speak, because speech is something. Nothing cannot be embodied"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}